  p("This beta brings together reported occurrences and experimental climate-suitability projections for emerald ash borer, oak processionary moth and mountain pine beetle."),
  tags$h3("Developer and contact"),
  p(strong("Alexandra Nagy")),
  p("Questions, feedback or a problem with the beta? ",
    tags$a("nagy.alexandra9519@gmail.com", href = "mailto:nagy.alexandra9519@gmail.com")),
  tags$h3("Support"),
  p("Developed with support from LNU Innovation."),
  tags$img(src = lnu_logo, alt = "Linnéuniversitetet", class = "lnu-about-logo"),
  tags$h3("Data and credits"),
  tags$ul(tags$li("Occurrence records: GBIF; original records are linked from map points."),
    tags$li("Climate suitability: InvaSkog MaxEnt models; provisional CRU-derived 2001–2020 baseline and WorldClim-downscaled CMIP6 future inputs. See How it works for preparation and limitations."),
    tags$li("Satellite imagery: Esri and the contributors credited on the map."),
